Package: openmixer-release
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenMixer package repository configuration for apt
 Adds the apt source of the OpenMixer repository, which carries the OpenMixer
 console and its plugin hosts, with the key that signs its index. The source
 names the Debian release of the system it is installed on (bookworm or
 trixie, Raspberry Pi OS included). apt upgrade keeps this configuration
 current.
